{"seq":3,"slug":"large-table-migration","title":"大表迁移","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/schema-migration-evolution/online-ddl/large-table-migration","wordCount":1736,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"大表迁移\">大表迁移</h1><p>在线变更工具让「改一张表」不再长锁，但当这张表有五亿行、上 TB 大小、且每秒承接上万次写时，问题从「能不能改」变成了「怎么在不影响线上、不拖垮从库、还能扛住中途中断的前提下，用几小时到几天稳稳地改完」。亿行尺度会把每一个在小表上无关紧要的参数放大成成败关键：批太大拖垮线上，批太小跑不完；不限速则复制延迟爆炸，限速过死则迁移遥遥无期。本篇把前两篇的锁知识与工具机制，放到这个极端尺度上检验。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>大表迁移的本质是一场「在不干扰前台的约束下，把海量数据从旧结构搬到新结构」的长跑。它要同时管好四件事：<strong>分块拷贝</strong>（每批多少行）、<strong>自适应限流</strong>（跟着系统健康动态调速）、<strong>可续跑</strong>（中断后从断点继续而非重来）、<strong>外键与从库</strong>（亿行表往往牵连复杂依赖）。这四件事与<a href=\"../patterns/backfill-strategies\">数据回填策略</a>里的回填高度同构——区别在于回填搬的是逻辑上的列数据，而这里搬的是工具影子表的整表拷贝；但分批、限速、幂等续跑的工程审美完全一致。</p>\n<p>下图给出一次大表迁移在运行期的反馈控制环，它的核心是「拷一批 → 看健康 → 调速」的闭环：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[迁移开始:确定主键区间与批大小] --&gt; B[拷贝一个数据块到影子表]&#10;  B --&gt; C[追平此期间原表增量变更]&#10;  C --&gt; D[采集健康指标:复制延迟/负载/锁等待]&#10;  D --&gt; E{复制延迟超阈?}&#10;  E --&gt;|是| F[节流:暂停或放慢下一批]&#10;  E --&gt;|否| G[维持或加速]&#10;  F --&gt; H[持久化进度游标]&#10;  G --&gt; H&#10;  H --&gt; I{全部块拷完?}&#10;  I --&gt;|否| B&#10;  I --&gt;|是| J[最终一致性校验]&#10;  J --&gt; K[选低峰期执行秒级切换]\">flowchart TD\n  A[迁移开始:确定主键区间与批大小] --&gt; B[拷贝一个数据块到影子表]\n  B --&gt; C[追平此期间原表增量变更]\n  C --&gt; D[采集健康指标:复制延迟/负载/锁等待]\n  D --&gt; E{复制延迟超阈?}\n  E --&gt;|是| F[节流:暂停或放慢下一批]\n  E --&gt;|否| G[维持或加速]\n  F --&gt; H[持久化进度游标]\n  G --&gt; H\n  H --&gt; I{全部块拷完?}\n  I --&gt;|否| B\n  I --&gt;|是| J[最终一致性校验]\n  J --&gt; K[选低峰期执行秒级切换]</pre><p>亿行尺度下几个关键参数的取舍如下：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>参数</th>\n<th>设太激进</th>\n<th>设太保守</th>\n<th>大表经验取向</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>批/块大小</td>\n<td>单批锁久、复制延迟飙</td>\n<td>总时长拖到数天</td>\n<td>中等，跟延迟动态收放</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>限流阈值（复制延迟）</td>\n<td>从库追不上、读副本失效</td>\n<td>迁移几乎停滞</td>\n<td>设为可容忍延迟上限</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>切换时机</td>\n<td>高峰切换风险大</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>选业务低峰窗口</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>外键处理</td>\n<td>迁移中触发约束检查变慢</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>多数工具要求先解后建</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"自适应限流-复制延迟是总开关\">自适应限流：复制延迟是总开关</h2><p>大表迁移会产生持续而可观的写入——无论是工具拷贝影子表，还是回填存量——这些写都要传播到每一个从库。一旦迁移速度超过从库的回放速度，复制延迟就会单调累积，从库越落越远，最终危及读副本的有效性与故障切换的安全。因此复制延迟是大表迁移的<strong>总开关</strong>：所有工具（gh-ost、pt-osc）都内建了基于复制延迟的限流。</p>\n<p>限流逻辑可以形式化。设当前复制延迟为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span>、可容忍上限为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_{max}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，迁移以一个无量纲的吞吐因子 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta \\in [0,1]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span> 调速：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></mrow><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mi>L</mi><msub><mi>L</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mn>1</mn><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta = \\mathrm{clamp}\\left(1 - \\frac{L}{L_{max}}, \\ 0, \\ 1\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">clamp</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>当延迟为零时 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta = 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 全速跑，延迟逼近上限时 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi><mo>→</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta \\to 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 几乎停下，超过上限则彻底暂停等延迟回落。gh-ost 因为追平走异步 binlog，对这种动态调速尤其在行（见前一篇<a href=\"online-schema-tools\">在线模式变更工具</a>）。复制延迟为何对高可用如此致命、它在不同复制模式下的表现，属于兄弟 hub，见<a href=\"../../database-replication-ha/foundations/sync-async-replication\">数据库复制与高可用</a>。除复制延迟外，还应监控主库负载、锁等待、磁盘 IO，任一超标都触发节流。</p>\n<h2 id=\"可续跑-几天的迁移必然会被打断\">可续跑：几天的迁移必然会被打断</h2><p>一次亿行迁移可能持续数小时到数天。在这么长的窗口里，进程崩溃、机器重启、网络抖动、人为暂停几乎必然发生。如果一次中断就要从头再来，迁移将永远完不成。因此<strong>可续跑</strong>不是锦上添花，而是大表迁移的硬需求。</p>\n<p>可续跑依赖两点：进度的持久化游标，以及拷贝操作的幂等性。工具把「已拷到哪个主键」持久化，重启后从游标继续；幂等保证重复处理同一区间不会出错。pt-osc 提供 <code>--resume</code>，gh-ost 也支持中断后衔接。这套机制与回填的续跑（<a href=\"../patterns/backfill-strategies\">数据回填策略</a>里用 <code>IS NULL</code> 守卫 + 持久化游标）是同一种设计。运维上还有一条配套纪律：迁移要可随时<strong>暂停/恢复</strong>，以便在线上突发流量高峰时主动把它停下，让出资源，高峰过后再续——把一次刚性的长操作变成一个可被调度的弹性后台任务。</p>\n<h2 id=\"外键-从库与切换窗口\">外键、从库与切换窗口</h2><p>亿行表往往不是孤立的，它通常处在外键关系网中，且有多个从库。这两点都让大表迁移更棘手。<strong>外键</strong>：影子表方案要把数据拷到一张新表再 <code>RENAME</code> 对调，而外键约束指向的是具体表，对调会让约束悬空。gh-ost 干脆要求先处理掉外键；pt-osc 有处理外键的选项但更慢更复杂。实务上常见做法是迁移前先解除外键、迁移后再重建，并在应用层临时承担引用完整性的校验。</p>\n<p><strong>从库与切换窗口</strong>：最后那一下原子切换虽然只有秒级锁，但它会作为一个 DDL 事件传播到所有从库，并在切换瞬间对原表与影子表都取强锁。因此切换应安排在<strong>业务低峰窗口</strong>，并确认此刻复制延迟已收敛到很低——否则切换信号到达从库时若从库正落后，会放大切换的可见影响。把迁移的「漫长拷贝」与「瞬时切换」解耦，让拷贝随时跑、把切换攒到一个精心挑选的安静时刻执行，是大表迁移调度的核心智慧。整个过程对线上的影响为什么必须压到最低，根源仍在<a href=\"../foundations/why-schema-migration\">模式演进的挑战</a>里那个「在线、有状态、双版本」的三重约束。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>大表迁移把小表上无关紧要的参数放大成成败关键，核心是在不扰前台的约束下用数小时到数天稳稳搬完海量数据。</li>\n<li>复制延迟是总开关：所有工具基于它自适应限流，吞吐因子 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>L</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>L</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta = \\mathrm{clamp}(1 - L/L_{max}, 0, 1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">clamp</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，延迟逼近上限即趋停。</li>\n<li>可续跑是硬需求而非锦上添花：靠持久化游标 + 幂等，工具提供 --resume；并应可随时暂停/恢复以让位于流量高峰。</li>\n<li>外键须迁移前解除、迁移后重建，期间引用完整性临时由应用层承担。</li>\n<li>把漫长拷贝与瞬时切换解耦，拷贝随时跑、切换攒到低峰且复制延迟收敛时执行，是调度核心。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>同章上一篇：<a href=\"online-schema-tools\">在线模式变更工具</a> — 这些工具的内部机制。</li>\n<li>同章基石：<a href=\"locking-ddl\">DDL 锁与阻塞</a> — 大表长锁为何致命。</li>\n<li>同构的搬数机制：<a href=\"../patterns/backfill-strategies\">数据回填策略</a>。</li>\n<li>跨库链接：复制延迟与读副本/故障切换的关系，见<a href=\"../../database-replication-ha/foundations/sync-async-replication\">数据库复制与高可用</a>；亿行表常需先分片，见<a href=\"../../database-sharding-partitioning/foundations/why-partition\">数据库分片与分区</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"大表迁移","id":"大表迁移"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"自适应限流：复制延迟是总开关","id":"自适应限流-复制延迟是总开关"},{"level":2,"text":"可续跑：几天的迁移必然会被打断","id":"可续跑-几天的迁移必然会被打断"},{"level":2,"text":"外键、从库与切换窗口","id":"外键-从库与切换窗口"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"在线模式变更工具","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/schema-migration-evolution/online-ddl/online-schema-tools"},"next":{"title":"迁移流水线与门禁","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/schema-migration-evolution/practice/migration-pipelines"}}